{"version":1,"content":"<p>爆料者定焦數碼近日在微博稱，目前能確認的iPhone 18e主要升級是新一代晶片，其他重大變化不多。該爆料者此前曾正確預測iPhone 17e會保留劉海屏，儘管當時另有消息稱該機可能改用靈動島；這或許意味着18e也不會採用靈動島，但爆料者並未明確作出這一判斷。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585018.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T13:06:32.123870+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:47:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:58:54.365324+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:58:54.365324+00:00","content_hash":"05165cfaa775b1d903180d65a7fc8c0c876ef512df2fd3c447e8ba1269280ede","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}